  "content": "<p data-pid=\"LYe6bxYE\">以前我也是Kotlin信徒，直到现在我也觉得Kotlin在语言上可圈可点。</p><p data-pid=\"6e1vbR2W\">但Jvm系的基础设施开发体验真的是稀烂，尤其是整个Maven/Gradle体系。</p><p data-pid=\"ZuszR6c7\">卡、慢、臃肿无处不在。开项目、构建、启动，简直像在屎坑里打滚。</p><p data-pid=\"bHOxRKr4\">举个例子，.Net的Roslyn的代码生成是实时的，不断的检查代码变动，MSBuild会随时生成代码。</p><p data-pid=\"7NsUwLvi\">你能想象出，Kotlin每写一行代码，Gradle就重新Build一遍的样子吗？</p><p data-pid=\"xF05p1AV\">另外就是涉及到Native方面，无论是AOT还是JNI，你就用吧，一用一个不吱声。</p><p data-pid=\"iG7VZFV6\">Jvm体系根本就不是通用的解决方案，他只能在Web和Android撒欢。</p><p data-pid=\"MOnRAmi4\">Kotlin只能自己搓一个Kotlin Multiplatform，想突破限制，但做了几年也没什么成效。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"yCOyOsbm\">但如果你问我最喜欢的语言，我仍然会答Kotlin。</p><p data-pid=\"7721-ZOK\">尤其是玩Compose的时候，被mvvm强暴了多少年的大脑，都感到了一丝通透。</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"n\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"nf\">MessageCard</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Message</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">Row</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">Image</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">painter</span> <span class=\"p\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">painterResource</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">drawable</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">profile_picture</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">contentDescription</span> <span class=\"p\">=</span> <span class=\"s\">&#34;Contact profile picture&#34;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    \n       <span class=\"n\">Column</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">Text</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">text</span> <span class=\"p\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">author</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">Text</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">text</span> <span class=\"p\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"nf\">Conversation</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">messages</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">Message</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">LazyColumn</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">messages</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"n\">message</span> <span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">MessageCard</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">message</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span></code></pre></div><p data-pid=\"8cg0GPkp\">C#再进化十年也学不来的。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"VNL-E90J\">评论区有些朋友不了解Kotlin的DSL，误以为Kotlin的Lambda只是省了几个括号。</p><p data-pid=\"zVOnIun2\">实际上Kotlin的Lambda包含了隐含this作用域，隐含it参数等重要内容。这两个让Kotlin的Lambda有了质的差距。</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"nf\">List</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">scope</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">ListScope</span><span class=\"p\">.()</span> <span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"nc\">ListScope</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"nf\">ListScope</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Item</span><span class=\"p\">(){</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span></code></pre></div><p data-pid=\"AMLUdDzq\">上述代码中，Item只允许在List的作用域内使用，无法在外部使用。</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"n\">List</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">Item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span></code></pre></div><p data-pid=\"zFn1Y7iR\">如果使用其他语言，就无法省略this作用域。</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> \n   <span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"p\">});</span>\n</code></pre></div><p data-pid=\"SUEbCDqJ\">这种情况下，两者的代码量差距就明显了，如果是多层嵌套：</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><code class=\"language-kotlin\"><span class=\"n\">A</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">B</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">C</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n            \n        <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"n\">D</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">E</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n            \n        <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span></code></pre></div><p data-pid=\"VntnfBx3\">换做其他语言如C#就会变得臃肿无比。</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><code class=\"language-csharp\"><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s1</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">s1</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s2</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">s2</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s3</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n           \n        <span class=\"p\">});</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">});</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">s1</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">D</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s2</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">s2</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s3</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"p\">});</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">});</span>\n<span class=\"p\">});</span>\n</code></pre></div><p data-pid=\"xQKTSL93\">实际上Kotlin的Lambda设计的并不是很好，有些情况下需要打补丁。但奈何他的体验是独一份的，找不到更好的代餐。</p>",
